{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/fbea92c7b6703c46ce5e51b55722e9f5.poster.avif?t=1765440645\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/fbea92c7b6703c46ce5e51b55722e9f5.webm?t=1765440645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield of the 1990s and early 2000s comes alive in a war where strategy meets direct control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Armored vehicles grind forward, infantry secure positions, and every decision you make shifts the balance of power.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/9aa540bc54373145ade59114d09c6de0.poster.avif?t=1765440645\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/9aa540bc54373145ade59114d09c6de0.webm?t=1765440645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the heart of it all \u2014 free to command the operation from above or take matters into your own hands. Issue orders, move formations, and oversee the flow of combat\u2026 or jump into the driver\u2019s seat, man a turret, or step into the boots of a soldier. Switch instantly between the wide lens of a commander and the ground-level intensity of third-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >person and first-person control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks, armored personnel carriers, and support units all play their part. Positioning, timing, and coordination decide who holds the line and who is pushed back. Yet when the battle turns critical, sometimes it takes one well-placed shot \u2014 yours \u2014 to turn defeat into victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/3f8fe12f4c210913a7f20c1e14221621.poster.avif?t=1765440645\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/3f8fe12f4c210913a7f20c1e14221621.webm?t=1765440645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your war to shape. Plan it, command it, fight it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032090?t=1765440645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032090?t=1765440645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/4043aba7b1b2a5d89286899f6c909ecb3b7cb9d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765440645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/4043aba7b1b2a5d89286899f6c909ecb3b7cb9d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765440645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032090/extras/fbea92c7b6703c46ce